---
title: "transfer_locked (Sui Move Concepts: Custom Transfer Rules)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_check_locked: check object.unlocked == false
    q_check_locked --> q_transfer: object.unlocked == false (locked)
    q_check_locked --> q_abort: object.unlocked == true (not locked)
    q_transfer --> q_set_owner: transfer::transfer(object, HOME_ADDRESS)
    q_set_owner --> [*]: object transferred to 0xCAFE

    q_abort --> [*]: abort EObjectNotLocked

    note right of q_check_locked
        INV-001: Locked objects can only be transferred to HOME_ADDRESS (0xCAFE)
        INV-002: Locked transfer does not accept arbitrary recipient
    end note

    note right of q_transfer
        INV-003: Defines exclusive transfer paths - unlocked to any, locked to HOME only
        INV-004: No other transfer mechanism exists for objects without store ability
    end note
